  accepted210 parent-load records have no worker entry. Reuse parent loader/guard,
  but require finite worker admission and cleanup receipts before runtime GO.
  Do not infer worker coverage from214 declarations,858 files or210 parent modules.

G01/G02 are source-declared limitations, not newly executed failures or full GNU
incompatibility findings. No suspected product defect has been established.
Early report: /tmp/priority-command-workflows-prep-20260828-gap.txt.

A different review must approve literal expectations, infrastructure controls,
worker admission and the future adapter before a separately recorded root GO.
GO must name this packet's committed bytes, exact tools/source/package, three
