      "reason": "Register one idempotent host cleanup synchronously before admitting acquisition. Root abort rejects acquisition with the identical caller object, cleanup releases its finite gate, and exec rejection awaits registered cleanup. Call Shell.dispose twice, require shared completion and one disposal. Not arbitrary promise preemption.",
