are not asserted. Explicit absent lists supplement this whole-namespace check;
no extra transient write is excused by later deleting it. Snapshot/setup reads are
separate harness roles and must not pollute command read/write traces.

Infrastructure wrappers forward capabilities, signals, bytes and methods faithfully;
outer VFS API calls alone count as mutation events, not Memory's internal calls.
Without a per-case exactCalls guard, mutation attempts are permitted only at the
literal changedFiles paths and must have the exact final bytes; no exact call-count
claim is made there. Read guards assert only enumerated properties, not invented
universal read counts. Discovered-file ignore metadata probes are allowed; no
ambient host content or credentials are. Network rows require exact route order,
method/headers/body bytes and no extra authorizations/requests. Body absence (null)
is distinct from an empty upload. Compare auth data including absent redirectFrom;
signal/registerCleanup are separately observed capabilities, not serialized values.

Normal mock responses use finite explicit iterators: each declared chunk once,
then one done; natural exhaustion means return0. A redirected response is disposed
without constructing its body iterator. Dispose is one shared idempotent completion;
count actual underlying invocations, not repeated calls of the product's wrapper.
C05's admitted host acquisition has synchronous cleanup enrollment and a finite
release gate. C07 intentionally does not: its promise remains pending at exec
settlement, is then explicitly rejected, and must settle before harness teardown.
No control claims arbitrary host preemption, universal cleanup, constant memory,
provider transactionality, DNS confinement or RSS containment.

